# The eighth battle (stage 7) won by play, from the made save after stage 6
# (stage_06_made): both sides load that file alike. Battle messages are
# answered after still:200 (finding 10). Hands-off, the battle stalls: by
# 07:38 the lance's leader has lost its left leg and can't walk, the next
# unit leads but stands at its route's end, and the last enemy (unit 19),
# its speed set to stop, waits across the map at 5,65; from 07:38:10 nothing
# moves or fires again (with upgrade_lance_pursuit on: stage_07_pursuit). So
# at a quiet step past 07:41 the second unit (F2) is ordered to unit 19, the
# third follows it, and the two win at 07:43. The transmission after it, then Save & Continue
# to slot 1: the save is REVENGE_SAVE_STAGE_07.
# set: campaign
# start-save: REVENGE_SAVE_STAGE_06
# Load Game, slot 1; the battle running.
idle:1000 Return idle:50 Right idle:50 Return idle:300
Return steps:2 @snap:stage7_battle
# The battle's stops: messages at 07:34:33, :57 and 07:35:42, a unit's loss
# reported at 07:34:44 and 07:36:54 (each prompt continued).
still:200 @snap:stage7_message1 Return idle:300
still:200 @snap:stage7_message2 Return idle:300
still:200 @snap:stage7_message3 Return idle:300
still:200 @snap:stage7_message4 Return idle:300
still:200 @snap:stage7_message5 Return idle:300
# 200 steps on (07:41): the last near enemy gone, the leader unable to move.
steps:200 @snap:stage7_quiet
# The second unit's Commands (F2, Return back to back: an idle in a running
# battle costs the original a frame a poll, the harness a millisecond), then
# Move: the cursor 35 cells down and left, then 39 left, at unit 19; the order
# given (Done). The battle waits while the menu is up.
F2 Return idle:300 Return idle:300
End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20 End idle:20
Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20 Left idle:20
idle:100 @snap:stage7_cursor Return idle:300 Return idle:300 @snap:stage7_commands
Return steps:1 @snap:stage7_ordered
# The walk and the fight: unit 19 destroyed, the battle won (07:43).
still:200 @snap:stage7_won Return idle:300
# The transmission after it, each page answered.
still:2000 @snap:stage7_after1 Return idle:300
still:2000 @snap:stage7_after2 Return idle:300
# The menu over it: Save & Continue to slot 1, as stage_05 does.
still:2000 @snap:stage7_menu
Down idle:50 Down idle:50 @snap:stage7_save
Return idle:300 @snap:stage7_slots
Return idle:300 @snap:stage7_save1 Return idle:300 @snap:stage7_save2
# Saved; the story goes on to stage 8.
Return idle:600 @snap:stage7_saved
